WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,370 --> 00:00:01,970
The jailer king didn't stop him

2
00:00:02,330 --> 00:00:03,650
Show that this approach can be used

3
00:00:04,290 --> 00:00:09,950
But the tactics need to be adjusted, so be careful next time

4
00:00:10,310 --> 00:00:17,220
The water inlet pipe is good

5
00:00:20,270 --> 00:00:21,790
Thank nature for waiting for others' guilt

6
00:00:23,740 --> 00:00:24,820
Don't let them go together

7
00:00:24,820 --> 00:00:25,780
Just play this kind of trick

8
00:00:25,780 --> 00:00:26,900
These three little bastards

9
00:00:26,900 --> 00:00:28,140
You think I'm a fool

10
00:00:30,380 --> 00:00:33,340
How many of you still have the nerve to laugh at six people?

11
00:00:33,740 --> 00:00:35,580
Being adjusted by three people one by one

12
00:00:35,580 --> 00:00:37,860
Do you dare to watch the excitement and go back to watch the replay?

13
00:00:38,140 --> 00:00:40,220
It’s just how stupid I was at the time, but

14
00:00:40,380 --> 00:00:42,500
He unloaded my gun so close

15
00:00:42,500 --> 00:00:43,660
You won't be weak without the gun

16
00:00:43,820 --> 00:00:49,500
But he held up the gun and said he dared to shoot the teacher

17
00:00:49,660 --> 00:00:52,860
It's me who didn't lead the team well. We knew it was twenty. You didn't lead the team well, knowing that the number of people was wrong.

18
00:00:52,860 --> 00:00:54,020
Not getting everyone together yet

19
00:00:54,020 --> 00:00:55,340
Continue to line up and arrest people one by one.

20
00:00:55,340 --> 00:00:56,620
After falling, let your teammates run first

21
00:00:56,620 --> 00:00:58,100
Do you feel that you are particularly brave?

22
00:00:58,100 --> 00:00:59,820
Do you hear the sound of water in your head?
